WEBVTT

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:23.650
This is Princess Chi.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:38.290
It's here.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.200
Good evening.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.970
It's been a while.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:26.440
I came to see you because I want to be a small princess.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.420
Wake up!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.980
Princess, please calm down!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.430
Calm down, boy.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:18.020
Hey, what happened?

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:36.400
You mean the world 300 years ago?

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.830
Yes! It's the legendary Pricure!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:42.250
Nice to meet you! I'm...

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.480
Cure Wing.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:50.500
Flying in the sky, protecting a small princess, and expanding her dreams.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.800
Do you know me?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.370
Cure Butterfly.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:05:00.000
Fighting to protect everyone, and aiming to become the strongest nursery child.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.410
The dark-skinned Pricure?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:06.270
Don't call me dark-skinned! Even though I'm a legend?

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.610
No!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.360
I-I feel like I've changed my personality.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:19.830
Fufufu. I could only watch over you from above the sky, but I was finally able to come to see you.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:27.590
300 years ago, the gentle Kaiserin who ended the battle was trying to destroy Skyland now.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.730
Why did she change?

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.520
After uniting the Underg Empire and the Japanese army, what happened?

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:40.390
Please tell me, Princess Ellraine!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.860
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:47.460
I don't know anything more than what you've seen.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.030
Happy birthday.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.850
I made this myself.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:58.070
Oh, it's so cute!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:07.240
The two worlds, Skyland and the Underg Empire, have formed an effective relationship.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:15.190
However, all of a sudden, they had a one-sided interaction with Skyland.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:28.520
The tunnel would never open again, and I had a bad feeling that I didn't know what would happen to Kaizerin and Kaiser after that.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:54.100
For the sake of when something happens, I left my power in the form of a book.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:07:00.000
I believe that the heroes who follow my will will take over Majesty Clinical.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:17.920
We've been saved by your power many times. Please keep watching over us from now on.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:29.480
Hey, little princess, can you show us what you can do with the power I sent you earlier?

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.310
This is the final power.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:21.190
A year ago, I felt the sudden rise of Underg Energy.

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:25.890
It was an emergency that was in dire danger.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:30.000
Against Underg Energy.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:38.220
I've been using the power I've accumulated over the past 300 years to send you to the ground.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:45.930
And the last power I sent you earlier was the last power I had.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:52.050
Oh, um, what's going to happen to Mr. Ellain?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:59.030
Oh, no!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.410
I've been watching over the island.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:18.330
The time has come for you to take on that role.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:21.600
The tomorrow of this world is to live today.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.520
I'll entrust it to your hands.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.940
I'm so happy to see you, big princess.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:43.450
Me too, little princess.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:47.010
Thank you so much for protecting this child.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:50.550
There were a lot of hard and painful things.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.530
I'm sorry.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.270
There were a lot of fun things too!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:59.030
Thank you for letting me meet El-chan!

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:09.960
Please tell the king and queen of this era who have pushed a cruel fate.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.270
I'm sorry.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.880
And thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:43.210
I hope the wonderful world where people, birds, and dragons live together will continue for a long time.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:52.950
Bye bye, Mr. Number One. Thank you, Legendary Precure.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.700
What?

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:58.570
P-Princess, where are you?

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.000
I'm here.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.670
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:08.960
You've become such a wonderful sister.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:16.090
Thank you for taking care of me all this time.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:20.010
Thank you for accepting me from the sky.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:29.570
I'm sorry. I feel like you've gone far away.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.000
I have a request.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.410
What is it?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:37.810
After you finish what you have to do and your fate is in your hands,

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:44.310
let me be by your side from now on.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:00.000
When I was hungry, I went back to being a child.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.440
That's it!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:06.800
Both the big princess and the little princess are so cute!

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.920
Really?

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:15.710
All encounters are fates.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:20.040
There was not a single meaningless encounter.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:26.340
Even the encounter with Kaizerin, I'm sure...

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:45.480
Where are you going?

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:49.480
I will not allow you to go to Skyland!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:53.660
Your Majesty has been completely awakened.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.680
I have to crush you now.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:59.010
What will happen to me if you are gone?

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.000
The recovery device...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.460
Even if it's not me, this life will move.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.580
It's not like that.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.850
It's not like that.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:10.660
Don't go!

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.840
If it's to protect you,

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.650
I don't want this life.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:22.150
You finally showed up.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:37.230
Smash it!

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:45.610
It's okay. My barrier isn't that weak.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:51.770
If I keep attacking like this, someday...

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.310
If the barrier is destroyed, I won't be able to protect the city!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.180
Everyone!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.730
Huh?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.360
It's the hero's turn!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.020
The boundless blue sky!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:16.360
The gentle light that spreads slowly!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.360
Cure Prism!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:24.770
The courage that spreads high in the heavens!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:25.770
Cure Wing!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.210
I'll raise you to the sky!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:39.190
Cure Butterfly!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.190
I'll set you free!

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:50.320
Cure Manesty!

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:57.960
I'll spread the sky!

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:59.510
Stop it!

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:12.660
This is the power received from Cure Noble.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:25.160
I see, it's strong, but it's not enough to cut into the palace of knowledge.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.510
Because the one I love wants it.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:38.250
You're fighting for Kaizerin!

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.080
What's wrong with that?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.400
Tell me, Kaizerin!

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:44.790
I refuse.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.860
Underg Energy, summon!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.840
Ryo is stronger than me?

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.700
This is the first time I've ever seen a battle like this.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:36.690
Let's go!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:04.000
Hang in there. Our turn is coming.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:10.500
Besides, this is not a Precure that can be destroyed like Rambog.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:19:00.000
I'll show you what I've got!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.270
You've lost your power.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.510
I'm not fighting to defeat you.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:10.470
Our power is to protect everyone.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:14.440
It's not that much power.

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:18.710
Skia Head!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.430
That's enough.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:24.970
Oh, my God! That's...

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:28.110
I've sealed your power.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:30.000
No way!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.510
I won't give you that time!

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:39.840
I'll at least take the lives of the two of you!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.480
For Kaiderin-sama's sake!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.980
Zen! ScareHead!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.200
Purple...

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:16.960
It's a gift.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:25.060
It's a secret to protect everyone from the Underg Energy.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.850
Majestic Veil!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.130
But...

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:43.860
I won't listen to that healing technique.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:50.160
Kaizerin-sama, this is the last lesson.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.970
All power.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:58.070
Therefore, those who have no power are miserable and sad.

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:00.000
More me.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:15.280
If I had the power, I could have protected you, but I'm sorry, Kaizerin-sama.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:22.820
Kurikiwa, all I have to do is take what's important from you!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:51.280
I'll let you go, Andarg.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:58.840
300 years ago, Andarg Empire and Skyland made peace, but...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.390
The Cure Nobles betrayed us and took our father!

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:09.540
It's a lie...

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.150
That's...

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.640
It's a lie!

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:20.080
I'm the Cure Majesty.

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:25.740
Everyone, dance with me.

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:30.000
In the sky, in the sky...

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:35.440
♪ Let's make tomorrow a wonderful day ♪

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:03.030
I'll cut off the Heisering!

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:05.050
Oh no, the city's barrier!

00:24:05.050 --> 00:24:06.210
I'll...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:09.500
We'll protect you!

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:11.540
Spreading Sky Freak is...

00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:12.540
Protect Hero!

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:13.800
Everyone's city!
